{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉周一表示，將向其德國超級工廠投資30億歐元（約合33億美元）。在德國本土競爭對手紛紛縮減規模之際，特斯拉此舉逆勢而行，彰顯了埃隆·馬斯克旗下的這家電動汽車製造商正全力推進其「Cybercab」車型的宏大擴張計劃。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586714.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.958730+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:06:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"6b85bd43b38d7e66ebe3f8286c8cafa41d5229b785f32fd52e5a7c5c2ba741dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}